hd38880: HD38880 speech engine.

Upstream attribution
--------------------
  rtl/hd38880_ctrl.v
    derived from : MAME src/mame/snk/snk6502_a.cpp (command protocol)
    authors      : Nicola Salmoria, Dan Boris (MAME copyright-holders)
    license      : BSD-3-Clause

  rtl/hd38880_top.v, hd38880_unpack.v, parcor_lattice.v, hd38880_dectab.v
    Own work (Rodimus), written from analysis of the speech data and the SK-6 board. parcor_lattice.v cites
    "Hitachi Hyoron Vol.63 No.12 (Dec 1981), Speech Synthesis LSIs" (a literature reference).
    hd38880_dectab.v holds amplitude / pitch / k1-k10 decode tables: empirical fits obtained by analysing the HD38880
    speech data (not values read from silicon).

  (MAME's file header names the copyright holders but gives no year.)

PENDING: confirm there is no human third-party code in the source package these files were delivered in
(Arcade-SNK6502_MiSTer "Useful Information/Ian Suggestions/"; its README and MANIFEST name no author and no license),
and decide knowingly about the decode tables (derived from the speech ROM contents).

